## What this covers

The research record and its accompanying prose:

  findings.md              the numbered findings ledger, including retractions
  what_it_measures.md      the synthesis
  critical_analysis.md     the adversarial audit
  explainer.md, assembly_theory.md, ca_constructions.md, tracker_dump.md
